[speaking Polish]
[door bell ring]

01:16:38.243 --> 01:16:45.280
There it is! I knew it!
I knew it!

01:16:45.280 --> 01:16:46.141
Yes?

01:16:46.141 --> 01:16:52.310
I knew that they would buzz right during the interview!

01:16:52.310 --> 01:16:55.830
Stefano: how nice it is to listening to you speaking Polish!

01:16:55.830 --> 01:16:58.574
Luca: Do you like it?
Stefano: Yes, I do!

01:16:58.574 --> 01:17:00.851
Luca: I saw that you were smiling.

01:17:00.851 --> 01:17:03.784
Stefano: Yeah, but it's also very weird 
doing "mmm, yeah, yeah..."

01:17:03.784 --> 01:17:07.105
while I don't understand!

